<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coast Dental started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coast Dental started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Ken Bohringer has started coverage of Coast Dental Services Inc with a rating of buy, a source at the brokerage said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the dental practice management services company closed on Monday at 13.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
